ription":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-08-06T22:00:38Z","updated_at":"2026-09-01T18:55:04Z","closed_at":"2026-09-01T18:32:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122178","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122178","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122178.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122178.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-01T18:32:20Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n- Closes #115018\r\n\r\nFog was not being disabled when using the \"Display Unshaded\" debug draw\r\nmode in the Compatibility (GLES3) renderer. This worked correctly in the\r\nForward+ renderer and in Godot 3.x, but was missing in the Compatibility\r\nrenderer's fog handling.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe `DISABLE_FOG` spec constant flag in `rasterizer_scene_gles3.cpp` was\r\nonly being set based on whether fog was enabled in the environment, but\r\ndid not check for `VIEWPORT_DEBUG_DRAW_UNSHADED`. Added that check so fog\r\nis disabled in Unshaded mode, consistent with how lights and reflection\r\nprobes are already skipped in that mode elsewhere in the same file.\r\n\r\nTested on Linux with the MRP from the issue:\r\n- Compatibility renderer: fog now correctly hidden in Unshaded mode\r\n- Forward+ renderer: unaffected, still works as before\r\n\r\n### AI disclosure\r\nI used Claude (Anthropic) as a debugging assistant to help me navigate\r\nthe codebase once I got help locating the related area I have located the error\r\n, I've fixed and reviewed it by myself through testing the mrp again. ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/o